 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "76:1-5 does not name who searched (the tafsirs differ: the searcher / Yusuf himself). «كذلك كدنا ليوسف» carries As-Sa'di's «الذي توصل به إلى أمر غير مذموم». Geometric for «إلا أن يشاء الله… وفوق كل ذي علم عليم». Their charge against Yusuf (77) is framed by «ومقصودهم تبرئة أنفسهم». 76: short-word flag (word 6, 70 ms), listen. STAGING v4: In the town, by the caravan (the brothers, a plain group of three in dark robes, and their camel). c1 (74-75): the caller's party asks (74:1; the same single man in plain robes as in 70-73, Al-Muyassar: those charged with the search) and the brothers answer with their own law (75:1, 75:9). No plate. c2 (76): Yusuf (blue drop labelled Yusuf, at the right; Al-Muyassar: they were brought back to him) and the brothers; the search is never acted out and nobody is shown searching (the tafsirs differ on who searched): only a wheat plate on their sacks of provisions (76:2-5); nothing is drawn when the cup is taken out (76:7-10), no cup, no bag and Binyamin is not drawn, so nobody is singled out. A geometric plate from 76:21 for Allah's will and knowledge. No glow or sparkle on Yusuf for the raised ranks. c3 (77): the brothers speak their charge (77:1) toward Yusuf without pointing at anyone and with no plate: it is framed by the gloss (their aim: to clear themselves). Yusuf keeps it to himself: no gesture and no speech beat on 77:17 (both tafsirs: he said it within himself); a geometric plate for Allah knows best (77:21)."
 },
